---
// Services Overview
---

<section id="services" class="section-padding bg-white">
  <div class="container-narrow">
    <div class="text-center mb-16 reveal">
      <span class="section-label">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M11.3 1.046A1 1 0 0112 2v5h4a1 1 0 01.82 1.573l-7 10A1 1 0 018 18v-5H4a1 1 0 01-.82-1.573l7-10a1 1 0 011.12-.38z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
        What We Do
      </span>
      <h2 class="section-title mb-4">Two pillars, one mission</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle mx-auto">
        We bring AI education to the next generation and build the software that powers modern businesses.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <!-- AI Courses Card -->
      <a href="#ai-courses" class="card group p-8 lg:p-10 reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-accent-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-accent-100 transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-accent-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M4.26 10.147a60.436 60.436 0 00-.491 6.347A48.627 48.627 0 0112 20.904a48.627 48.627 0 018.232-4.41 60.46 60.46 0 00-.491-6.347m-15.482 0a50.57 50.57 0 00-2.658-.813A59.905 59.905 0 0112 3.493a59.902 59.902 0 0110.399 5.84c-.896.248-1.783.52-2.658.814m-15.482 0A50.697 50.697 0 0112 13.489a50.702 50.702 0 017.74-3.342M6.75 15a.75.75 0 100-1.5.75.75 0 000 1.5zm0 0v-3.675A55.378 55.378 0 0112 8.443m-7.007 11.55A5.981 5.981 0 006.75 15.75v-1.5" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">AI Courses for Schools & Students</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Prepackaged AI curriculum aligned with the UAE Ministry of Education AI Framework. Ready-to-deploy courses for schools, with self-paced options for individual students.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            UAE MOE AI Framework aligned curriculum
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            Courses from foundational AI literacy to advanced ML
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            Institutional licensing and individual student access
          </li>
        </ul>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-600 font-semibold text-sm group-hover:gap-3 transition-all">
          Learn more
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
          </svg>
        </span>
      </a>

      <!-- Custom Software Card -->
      <a href="#custom-software" class="card group p-8 lg:p-10 reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-brand-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-brand-100 transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-brand-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 17.25v1.007a3 3 0 01-.879 2.122L7.5 21h9l-.621-.621A3 3 0 0115 18.257V17.25m6-12V15a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 013 15V5.25m18 0A2.25 2.25 0 0018.75 3H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 003 5.25m18 0V12a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 013 12V5.25" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Custom Desktop & Mobile Apps</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Bespoke applications for operations and maintenance — built for businesses and education institutions that need software tailored to how they actually work.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            Desktop applications for Windows, macOS, and Linux
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            Mobile apps for iOS and Android
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            Operations, maintenance, and workflow automation
          </li>
        </ul>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-600 font-semibold text-sm group-hover:gap-3 transition-all">
          Learn more
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
          </svg>
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
